{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15486","headline":"长安书事寄卢纶 · 李端","name":"长安书事寄卢纶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱冠家庐岳，从师岁月深。\n翻同老夫见，殊寡少年心。\n及此时方晏，因之名亦沈。\n趋途非要路，避事乐空林。\n素业在山下，青泉当树阴。\n交游有凋丧，离别代追寻。\n向秀初闻笛，锺期久罢琴。\n残愁犹满貌，余泪可沾襟。\n勿以朱颜好，而忘白发侵。\n终期入灵洞，相与链黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}